<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
	<link rel="icon" href="/images/logos.svg" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="64x64">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@2.44.0/tabler-icons.min.css">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <title>Tayangin - Live Stream Nonstop</title>
    <style>
        /* ================= VARIABLES & RESET ================= */
        :root {
            --primary-color: #d4f134; 
            --bg-color: #121212; 
            --text-color: #f3f4f6; 
            --text-gray: #a1a1aa; 
            --border-color: #27272a;
            --card-bg: #1e1e1e; 
            --font-main: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            line-height: 1.5;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			overflow-x:hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        /* ================= TYPOGRAPHY & BUTTONS ================= */
        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .btn-dark {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #111111;
        }

        .btn-dark:hover {
            background-color: #e5e5e5;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background-color: transparent;
            border-color: var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: #52525b;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: #111111;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            filter: brightness(0.9);
        }

        /* ================= LAYOUT UTILS ================= */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
        }

        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* ================= NAVBAR ================= */
        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            z-index: 100;
			border-bottom: none;
			box-shadow: none;
        }

        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 80px;
			position:relative;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
			z-index: 101;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }
		
		.nav-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
		
		.menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--text-color);
            z-index: 101; /* Pastikan tombol di atas menu mobile */
        }

        /* ================= HERO SECTION ================= */
        .hero {
            padding-top: 8rem;
            padding-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        /* ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= */
        .section-label {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .steps-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .step-card {
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: white;
        }

        .step-image-placeholder {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            height: 200px;
            width: 100%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .step-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
			background: var(--bg-color);
			text-align: left;
			padding-top: 2.5rem;
        }

        .step-number {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .step-title {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .step-desc {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }
		
		 /* ================= FITUR(PLATFORMS & CARDS) ================= */
        .use-cases-grid-fitur {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        .use-case-card-fitur {
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: var(--bg-color);
			text-align: left;
        }

        .use-case-icon-fitur {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }


        /* ================= WHO IT'S FOR (PLATFORMS & CARDS) ================= */
        .platforms-cloud {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .platform-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            background: var(--bg-color);
        }

        .use-cases-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        .use-case-card {
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: var(--bg-color);
			text-align: left;
        }

        .use-case-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        /* ================= PRICING ================= */
        .pricing-toggles {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0 3rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .toggle-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .pricing-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .pricing-card {
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: var(--bg-color);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .pricing-card.popular {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(212, 241, 52, 0.15);
        }

        .plan-name {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .badge {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .plan-desc {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            height: 40px;
			text-align: left;
        }

        .plan-price {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
        }

        .plan-price span {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .plan-features {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .plan-features li {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .plan-features li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        /* ================= FAQ ================= */
        .faq-section {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        
        .faq-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
            gap: 4rem;
        }

        .faq-accordion {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .faq-item {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .faq-question {
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .faq-question span {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-right: 1rem;
        }

        .faq-answer {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .faq-answer p {
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .footer-col ul {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-col a {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        .footer-col a:hover {
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }
		
		.pricing-flex {
			display: flex;
    	    justify-content: center;
    	    gap: 1.5rem;
    	    margin-top: 2rem;
		}

        /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .steps-grid, .use-cases-grid, .use-cases-grid-fitur, .pricing-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .faq-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }

                @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .hero-actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            /* Responsive Navbar / Hamburger Menu */
            .menu-toggle { 
                display: block; 
            }
            
            .nav-wrapper {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: -100%; /* Sembunyikan di luar layar */
                width: 100%;
                height: 100vh;
                background-color: var(--bg-color);
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 2rem;
                transition: left 0.3s ease-in-out;
                z-index: 100;
            }

            .nav-wrapper.active {
                left: 0; /* Tampilkan menu saat aktif */
            }

            .nav-links {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                gap: 2rem;
                width: 100%;
            }

            .nav-actions {
                flex-direction: column;
                width: 100%;
                margin-top: 2rem;
            }

            .nav-actions a, .nav-actions .btn {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }

            /* Rest of Responsive Settings */
            .steps-grid, .use-cases-grid, .use-cases-grid-fitur, .pricing-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                place-items: start !important; /* Rapikan teks ke kiri di mobile */
                text-align: left;
            }
            .hero { padding-top: 4rem; }
	    .pricing-flex {
        	flex-direction: column;
    	    }
        }
		
		@media (min-width: 769px) {
    	    .nav-links {
            	position: absolute;
        	left: 50%;
        	transform: translateX(-50%);
     	    }
		}
		
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header>
        <div class="container navbar">
			<div class="logo">
                <img src="/images/logos2.svg" alt="tayangin logo" class="w-20 h-20">
                tayangin
            </div>
            
            <!-- Hamburger Icon (Tampil di Mobile) -->
            <div class="menu-toggle" id="mobile-menu-btn">
                <i class="ti ti-menu-2"></i>
            </div>

            <!-- Wrapper Menu Navigasi -->
            <div class="nav-wrapper" id="nav-wrapper" >
                <nav class="nav-links">
                    <a href="#">Beranda</a>
                    <a href="#fitur">Fitur</a>
                    <a href="#harga">Harga</a>
                    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
                </nav>
                <div class="nav-actions">
                    <a href="/login">Masuk</a>
                    <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-dark">Daftar Gratis</a>
                </div>
			</div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- HERO SECTION -->
        <section class="hero text-center">
            <div class="container">
                <h1>24/7 Live Stream <span id="platform-text" style="color: var(--primary-color); transition: opacity 0.4s ease-in-out;">YouTube</span><br>dari Rekaman Video Kamu</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Tayangkan Rekaman Video Kamu ke YouTube, Shopee, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook dan Semua Platform RTMP — Nonstop.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-dark">Mulai Streaming →</a>
                    <a href="#tutorial" class="btn btn-outline">Tutorial Singkat</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
        <section class="text-center" id="tutorial">
            <div class="container">
                <span class="section-label">Tutorial Singkat</span>
                <h2>Tiga Langkah Untuk Melakukan Live Stream 24/7</h2>
                <p class="subtitle">Daftar, Upload, Tayang! Sisanya biar sistem kami yang handle.</p>

                <div class="steps-grid text-left">
                    <!-- Step 1 -->
                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-image-placeholder">
							<img alt="Pilih platform dan menaruh stream key di Tayangin" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-500 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-105" src="/images/step-upload-edit.svg">
						</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <div class="step-number">01</div>
                            <h3 class="step-title">Unggah rekaman video</h3>
                            <p class="step-desc">Unggah rekaman video kamu dari komputer atau dari penyimpanan online milikmu - Googledrive, Mediafire, Mega.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Step 2 -->
                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-image-placeholder">
							<img alt="Pilih platform dan menaruh stream key di Tayangin" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-500 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-105" src="/images/step-key-edit.svg">
						</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <div class="step-number">02</div>
                            <h3 class="step-title">Masukkan Stream Key Kamu</h3>
                            <p class="step-desc">Pilih platform yang Kamu mau — YouTube, Facebook, Instagram atau Tiktok — dan input stream key kamu di dashboard.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Step 3 -->
                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-image-placeholder">
							<img alt="Pilih platform dan menaruh stream key di Tayangin" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-500 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-105" src="/images/step-live-edit.svg">
						</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <div class="step-number">03</div>
                            <h3 class="step-title">Live Streaming 24/7</h3>
                            <p class="step-desc">Tekan tombol buat stream dan video kamu siap ditonton oleh jutaan orang di Internet tanpa perlu buka laptop lagi.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </section>
		
		<!-- FITUR -->
        <section class="text-center" id="fitur" style="background-color: var(--bg-color);">
            <div class="container">
                <span class="section-label">Fitur Unggulan</span>
                <h2>Semua yang kamu butuhkan untuk streaming 24/7 <br>sudah tersedia disini</h2>
                <p class="subtitle">Tayangin hadir sebagai ekosistem lengkap untuk memaksimalkan potensi live streaming kamu tanpa membebani device yang kamu miliki.</p>

                <div class="use-cases-grid-fitur text-left">
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur">
							<i class="ti ti-cloud-upload text-7xl"></i>
		
						</div>
                        <h4>24/7 Cloud Streaming</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Tidak perlu takut tagihan listrik atau kuota membengkak. Server kami yang akan melakukan streaming nonstop untuk Kamu.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur">
							<i class="ti ti-database text-2xl"></i>
						</div>
                        <h4>Smart File Upload</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Import video dari penyimpanan online kamu ke server kami dengan sekali klik. Menghemat waktu upload Kamu.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur"><i class="ti ti-stairs-up text-2xl"></i></div>
                        <h4>Storage Tracking</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Sistem kami akan memberi tahu penggunaan penyimpanan yang sudah kamu lakukan selama streaming.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur"><i class="ti ti-repeat text-2xl"></i></div>
                        <h4>Auto Looping</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">File kamu yang berdurasi 1 jam bisa dimainkan selama 24 jam nonstop dengan fitur auto looping yang kami miliki.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur"><i class="ti ti-calendar-time text-2xl"></i></div>
                        <h4>Auto Scheduling</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Kamu bisa melakukan penjadwalan pemutaran video tanpa perlu membuka dashboard lagi setelahnya.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card-fitur">
                        <div class="use-case-icon-fitur"><i class="ti ti-brand-youtube text-2xl"></i></div>
                        <h4>Multi Platform</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc-fitur" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Platform kami sudah mendukung streaming ke berbagai sosial media — Youtube, Facebook, TikTok dan platform Lain.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
        <section class="text-center" style="background-color: var(--bg-color);">
            <div class="container">
                <span class="section-label">Paling Pas Buat Siapa Sih?</span>
                <h2>Satu tools untuk tayangin <br>24/7 multi platform</h2>
                <p class="subtitle">Konten apapun yang kamu buat, Tayangin siap melakukan live streaming nonstop untuk kamu di berbagai platform yang kamu punya. Upload sekali, bikin playlist, dan menikmati hidup sepenuhnya.</p>

                <div class="platforms-cloud">
                    <span class="platform-pill">▶ YouTube</span>
                    <span class="platform-pill">🟣 Facebook</span>
                    <span class="platform-pill">🟢 Shopee</span>
                    <span class="platform-pill">🟩 Linkedin</span>
                    <span class="platform-pill">🎵 TikTok</span>
                    <span class="platform-pill">🔵 Instagram</span>
                </div>

                <div class="use-cases-grid text-left">
                    <div class="use-case-card">
                        <div class="use-case-icon"><i class="ti ti-music text-2xl"></i></div>
                        <h4>Channel music 24/7 & lofi</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Putar ulang kontenmu di Youtube live stream tanpa henti agar para penikmat musik dan lofi tidak ketinggalan.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card">
                        <div class="use-case-icon"><i class="ti ti-device-gamepad-2"></i></div>
                        <h4>Gamers & VOD</h4>
                        <p class="step-desc" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Tayangkan momen terbaik kamu di sosial media 24/7. Buat channelmu hidup walaupun kamu sedang dalam keadaan offline.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="use-case-card">
